OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 12 JAN
OL,4,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,5,     GGottfried von der Goltz directs
OL,6,     Gthe Freiburg Baroque Orchestra at
OL,7,     Ga concert from the 2025 Saar
OL,8,     GInternational Music Festival.
OL,9,G0630FBreakfast
OL,10,     GTom McKinney presents Radio 3's
OL,11,     GBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,12,     Gemail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,13,G0930FRadio 3's American Roadtrip
OL,14,     GGeorgia Mann presents live from
OL,15,     Gthe City of Angels, including a
OL,16,     Gvisit to the Hollywood Walk of
OL,17,     GFame, and live music from film
OL,18,     Gmusic pianist and conductor,
OL,19,     GScott Dunn.
