OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GElizabeth Alker showcases the
OL,6,     Gbest performances from the UK and
OL,7,     Gbeyond including the Casals
OL,8,     GQuartet playing Bach and
OL,9,     GShostakovich and orchestral music
OL,10,     Gfrom great American composers.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: Copland
OL,12,     GDonald Macleod traces Copland's
OL,13,     Glater years as conductor and
OL,14,     Gchronicler.
OL,15,G1700FIn Tune
OL,16,     GKatie Derham is joined by
OL,17,     Gviolinist Roman Mints for a live
OL,18,     Gperformance in studio, linked to
OL,19,     GLondon's Another Music Festival:
OL,20,     GDisplaced - which Roman curates.
